Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:07:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix validation scripts and add inventory contract test

- workflows:check: pass --ignoreConfig. With tsconfig.json present, TypeScript
  6.0.3 (lockfile pin) rejects a file-list invocation with TS5112.
- test:comms-orchestration: set PYTHONPATH to comms-orchestration. The test
  imports `orchestrator` from its parent directory, which discovery does not add.
- test:repository-inventory: the script referenced
  scripts/repository-inventory.test.mjs, which was never committed. Add it as a
  read-only contract test against a temporary fixture (5 cases).
- .gitignore: allowlist only scripts/repository-inventory.test.mjs. The root
  ignore file is deny-by-default, so the test would not reach CI otherwise.

Verified locally: workflows:check, test:comms-orchestration (7 tests),
test:repository-inventory (5 tests) pass. Not run here: full Vitest suite,
lint, typecheck, vite build (no installable dependencies in this environment).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
